  "text": "### Account Closure  \n**Process:**\n1. Verify customer identity\n2. Confirm closure request\n3. Calculate final balance (pending interest, fees)\n4. Print final statement\n5. Arrange payout method (transfer, cheque, cash)\n6. Deactivate account in system\n7. Provide closure receipt  \n---",
